@VisitTracker.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5212

### List all visits
GET {{VisitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/visits
Accept: application/json

### Add a visit
POST {{VisitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/visits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientName": "Ana Lopez",
  "caregiverName": "Bob Smith",
  "scheduledStart": "2026-10-28T09:00:00-05:00"
}

### Add an invalid visit (expect 400)
POST {{VisitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/visits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientName": "",
  "caregiverName": "Bob Smith"
}

### Visits missing a clock-in
GET {{VisitTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/visits/missing-clock-in
Accept: application/json

###
